<title>FINLAND: HUHTAMAKI BUYS CHINESE CHEWING GUM J/V.</title>
<headline>HUHTAMAKI BUYS CHINESE CHEWING GUM J/V.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish confectionery and food packaging group Huhtamaki Oy said in a statement on Thursday it would buy the remaining 50 percent of Chinese chewing gum joint venture Wuxi Leaf Confectionery Co for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;The new arrangement gives Huhtamaki full financial and management control over Wuxi Leaf,&quot; Huhtamaki said.</p>
<p>&quot;A new cooperative joint venture, to which Wuxi Commercial &amp; Industrial Corporation contributes the necessary land use rights, succeeds the original equity joint-venture,&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
